  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W43",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "最近大绿献力持续上升，本周直接登顶。而且不是前一阵子流行过的[[card:Nature's Rhythm|大自然的韵律]]版本（韵律版本也还存在），更多的是传统[[card:Leyline of the Guildpact|十会盟地脉]]版本。席卷的版本本周多加了一张[[card:Garruk, Curse Breaker|破咒猎人贾路]]：deck:6a6f0855442557d692be",
          "en": "Mono-Green Devotion has continued to rise recently and took the top spot this week. Most lists are the traditional [[card:Leyline of the Guildpact|Leyline of the Guildpact]] build, rather than the [[card:Nature's Rhythm|Nature's Rhythm]] version that was popular a little while ago, although that version is still around. This week’s winning list added one more [[card:Garruk, Curse Breaker|Garruk, Curse Breaker]]: deck:6a6f0855442557d692be"
        },
        "deck_links": [
          {
            "order": 1,
            "token": "deck:6a6f0855442557d692be",
            "label": {
              "zh": "大绿献力 · MandrillMan · 第1名",
              "en": "Mono-Green Devotion · MandrillMan · Rank 1"
            },
            "deck": {
              "archetype_id": "mono-green-devotion",
              "display_name": "Mono-Green Devotion",
              "event_id": "12856619",
