              "player": "MandrillMan",
              "final_rank": 1,
              "starttime": "2026-10-19 23:00:00.0"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "满编[[card:Tarmogoyf|塔莫耶夫]]的勇德躁狂本周拿下一个八强：deck:91f174b56c5e0abdbbf4。遥想当年[[card:Tarmogoyf|塔莫耶夫]]、[[card:Grim Flayer|残酷劫掠者]]都是摩登可用单卡，令人唏嘘。",
          "en": "Jund Delirium with a full playset of [[card:Tarmogoyf|Tarmogoyf]] made a Top 8 this week: deck:91f174b56c5e0abdbbf4. Looking back at when [[card:Tarmogoyf|Tarmogoyf]] and [[card:Grim Flayer|Grim Flayer]] both saw play in Modern is a little bittersweet."
        },
